lve the veteran in various activities. Maybe it will be a veteran business, maybe studios for filming YouTube channels, developing 3D models, this is medical rehabilitation,\" said Ihor Shyshko.<a href=\"https://telegram.me/share/url?text=%D0%9F%D1%96%D1%81%D0%BB%D1%8F%20%D1%81%D0%BB%D1%83%D0%B6%D0%B1%D0%B8%20%D1%83%20%D0%B2%D1%96%D0%B9%D1%81%D1%8C%D0%BA%D1%83%20%D1%96%20%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%BD%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%BD%D1%8F%20%D0%B7%20%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%BB%D0%BE%D0%BD%D1%83%20%D1%85%D0%B0%D1%80%D0%BA%D1%96%D0%B2%D0%B5%D1%86%D1%8C%20%D0%86%D0%B3%D0%BE%D1%80%20%D0%A8%D0%B8%D1%88%D0%BA%D0%BE%20%D0%BE%D1%87%D0%BE%D0%BB%D0%B8%D0%B2%20%D0%B7%D0%B0%D0%BA%D0%BB%D0%B0%D0%B4%2C%20%D1%8F%D0%BA%D0%B8%D0%B9%20%D0%B4%D0%BE%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%BC%D0%B0%D0%B3%D0%B0%D1%82%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%B5%20%D0%B2%D0%B5%D1%82%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%BC%20%D0%B2%D1%96%D0%B9%D0%BD%D0%B8&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fsuspilne.media%2Fkharkiv%2F930211-pisla-sluzbi-u-vijsku-i-povernenna-z-polonu-harkivec-igor-sisko-ocoliv-zaklad-akij-dopomagatime-veteranam-vijni%2F%3Futm_source%3Dtelegram%26utm_medium%3Dps\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"></a><a href=\"viber://forward?text=https%3A%2F%2Fsuspilne.media%2Fkharkiv%2F930211-pisla-sluzbi-u-vijsku-i-povernenna-z-polonu-harkivec-igor-sisko-ocoliv-zaklad-akij-dopomagatime-veteranam-vijni%2F%3Futm_source%3Dviber%26utm_medium%3Dps\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"></a><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fsuspilne.media%2Fkharkiv%2F930211-pisla-sluzbi-u-vijsku-i-povernenna-z-polonu-harkivec-igor-sisko-ocoliv-zaklad-akij-dopomagatime-veteranam-vijni%2F%3Futm_source%3Dfacebook%26utm_medium%3Dps\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"></a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:media-text -->', 'Igor Shyshko', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '565-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-10-29 21:54:02', '2025-10-29 19:54:02', '', 565, 'https://working-newly-locust.ngrok-free.app/?p=763', 0, 're